<div class="box">
  <div>
    <div class="body">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <h2>About GameBrowse</h2>
      <p>
        GameBrowse is a directory for community game servers and the mods they
        run. Server owners list what they host, players search and filter the
        catalog, and everyone gets a consistent place to look instead of a
        scattered set of forum posts.
      </p>
      <p>
        The catalog is searchable by name prefix, sortable on the fields that
        matter, and paged so the list stays fast as it grows. Signed in users
        can favorite servers, which are stored against their own account.
      </p>
      <hr>
      <div class="ads">
        <h2>How Search Works</h2>
        <p>
          Names are indexed in a trie, so a prefix lookup does not scan the
          full list. Ranking runs over a cached base ordering with per user
          adjustments applied on top.
        </p>
        <h2>Accounts</h2>
        <p>
          Listings are owned by the account that created them. Write access is
          checked by role, not just by whether a token is valid.
        </p>
      </div>
      <h2>Listing a Server</h2>
      <p>
        Sign in and add your server from the admin panel. You can edit or
        remove anything you own at any time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
